-host. Discovery hits `GET /v1/models` (10s timeout, OpenAI-style payload) and
-derives each model's `api` from the entry's `supported_endpoint_types`:
+같은 호스트에서 `/v1/messages`와 `/v1/chat/completions`를 모두 제공하는
